# Evidence Vault doctrine · per docs/EVIDENCE_VAULT_OBJECT_STORAGE_DOCTRINE.md
#
# Compute Bench bundles contain PRIVATE_EVIDENCE + DERIVED_DATASETS
# artifacts that MUST NOT be committed to a public repo. Only the
# PUBLIC_ASSETS subset (asset_identity · runtime_environment · benchmark_plan
# · workload_compatibility · public_safe_attestation · manifest.sha256) and
# the issued deed JSON may be tracked.
#
# Local bundles live in the operator's Evidence Vault · paths in this
# directory · NOT in the repo. The bundle hash anchored in the public-safe
# attestation is the integrity reference · operators verify by recomputing
# against their local bundle.

# Exclude PRIVATE_EVIDENCE files from any bundle directory
*/private_identity_reference.json
*/thermal_power_trace.jsonl
*/dcgmi_diag_output_private.json
*/*_private.json
*/*_private.jsonl

# Exclude DERIVED_DATASETS files (contain hostnames, raw serials, etc.)
*/system_manifest.json
*/health_diagnostic.json
*/benchmark_results.json
*/validator_flags.json
*/best_next_use_inputs.json
*/evidence_classification.json

# Explicit allowlist (override any prior pattern):
!*/asset_identity.json
!*/runtime_environment.json
!*/benchmark_plan.json
!*/workload_compatibility.json
!*/public_safe_attestation.json
!*/manifest.sha256
!*/ddeed-*.json
!.gitignore
!README.md
